" ><strong>Watch the Skies!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544390/extras/04843907aa984fa78af32730781d0ce4.poster.avif?t=1764012525\" width=780 height=316 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544390/extras/04843907aa984fa78af32730781d0ce4.webm?t=1764012525\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544390/extras/04843907aa984fa78af32730781d0ce4.mp4?t=1764012525\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But there's more than just seeding and watering! As Captain Rabbo and her indomitable sidekick, Dirk Doggo, you\u2019ll face wave upon wave of atrocious avian aggressors from the gluttonous Gale Gang! They fight to keep the land in a state of perpetual misery and desolation. Dodge, jab, and ram these formidable fowl, showing them that no matter what they try, your will to restore the landscape remains unbroken.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Restore the Land!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544390/extras/b01793fc3ed770c21835dc2e770b754a.poster.avif?t=1764012525\" width=780 height=316 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544390/extras/b01793fc3ed770c21835dc2e770b754a.webm?t=1764012525\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544390/extras/b01793fc3ed770c21835dc2e770b754a.mp4?t=1764012525\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you progress, Winrose will grow from a desolate warren into a bustling metropolis under Captain Robbo! Keep fighting off the Gale Gang, farming your crops, and attracting new recruits to the Air Hares. But beware: as you transform this fledging warren into a bountiful borough, you'll eventually confront the mighty Twin Horn in a battle that will decide the fate of all bunkind!</p>","developers":["Wondoro LLC"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544390/c5914cd046dc5d245414c309bc606cbab21317e3/header.jpg?t=1764012525","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 Wondoro LLC & Freedom Games - All Rights Reserved","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3544390/856259/55444c351aacc0261772497c2b052605a1661fa1/1750859447/dash_av1.mpd?t=1742918599","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3544390/856259/55444c351aacc0261772497c2b052605a1661fa1/1750859447/dash_h264.mpd?t=1742918599","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3544390/856259/55444c351aacc0261772497c2b052605a1661fa1/1750859447/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1742918599","id":257117650,"name":"Teaser","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257117650/74b706b61187e7c9221268d3bab4de5920c4414b/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1742918599"}],"name":"Air Hares","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Microsoft 64bit Windows 7<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 64bit Intel compatible Dual Core CPU<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 1 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> DX11 compliant graphics card<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 800 MB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Pro