,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544390/4590b72cf28d981988fd5eb258dbd4c1d4c9a95e/ss_4590b72cf28d981988fd5eb258dbd4c1d4c9a95e.1920x1080.jpg?t=1764012525","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544390/4590b72cf28d981988fd5eb258dbd4c1d4c9a95e/ss_4590b72cf28d981988fd5eb258dbd4c1d4c9a95e.600x338.jpg?t=1764012525"},{"id":9,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544390/1fa2530cdeadfd2366ab41676e14392df08bc030/ss_1fa2530cdeadfd2366ab41676e14392df08bc030.1920x1080.jpg?t=1764012525","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544390/1fa2530cdeadfd2366ab41676e14392df08bc030/ss_1fa2530cdeadfd2366ab41676e14392df08bc030.600x338.jpg?t=1764012525"}],"short_description":"Join the intrepid bunny pilot, Captain Rabbo, and her crew of fluffy flyers as they fight to turn the barren Winrose Warren into a blossoming landscape! Become an Air Hare in a unique take on bullet hells, restoring farmland one seed at a time, against the nefarious Gale Gang goons!","steam_appid":3544390,"support_info":{"email":"support@indie.io","url":""},"supported_languages":"English","type":"game","website":"http://www.airhares.com/"}